140	/**
141	 * Creates a deterministic hash from a list of variable names.
142	 * Used to group evals with the same "schema" for column visibility persistence.
143	 * Evals with the same set of variables will share column visibility preferences.
144	 *
145	 * @param varNames - Array of variable names from the eval
146	 * @returns A string hash representing the schema
